  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITR/T - International Telecommunication Union (ITU) - EQUALS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  This investment is to support the EQUALS global partnership for Gender Equality in the Digital Age, which is a multi-stakeholder coalition that focuses on closing the gender digital divide. It provides a way for USAID to engage with a broader set of stakeholders and use collective convening power and resources to sustainably move towards closing the gender digital divide as part of the Women in the Digital Economy Initiative. This aligns with USAID&apos;s goals as part of the newly-launched Women in the Digital Economy Fund (WiDEF) as well. Expanding upon the existing EQUALS community, which is managed through the EQUALS Hub hosted by ITU, EQUALS with USAID, working with the Gates Foundation, will support the Women in the Digital Economy Community of Practice (CoP) as a distinct project and deliverable of EQUALS.</narrative>
  </description>
